# Local credential files. `.env` holds the App Store Connect API key id/issuer
# and the path to the .p8 (see ios/README.md "Distribution (TestFlight)"); the
# .p8 itself lives outside the repo. Never commit either.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision

# webui/ — the browser control surface (specs/WEB_INTERFACE.md D9). Built
# output is embedded into the binary by src/web/assets.rs via `rust-embed`,
# which requires the folder to exist at Rust *compile* time even before any
# npm build has run — hence `webui/dist/.gitkeep` stays tracked while
# everything `npm run build` writes into `webui/dist/` is ignored below.
/webui/node_modules/
/webui/dist/*
!/webui/dist/.gitkeep
